7d012374f79c5d84d07ca3b68121c67d61ba5407 blob 1362
# V6 final Git preparation

This folder retains the independent root source review of the frozen V6/R1 packet, plus the complete owned neutral-result retention command receipts, the raw-whitespace rejection and the exact continuation that preserved the evidence bytes. Submitted scripts and observed Sentinel results are labeled separately.

The baseline run45008694456 remains an actual failed Native suite with strict12 PASS; four raw green negatives remain semantically unproven until the proposed20-case execution. The neutral result commit is66bdc665daea80efeb617199f92fb8c04a5289f2, verified on its remote branch.

Root's independent V6 review5d5188ec authorized final Git preparation only. It verified all73 frozen payloads /837,784B,16 original source identities,9 exact runner replacements with unchanged R2 ownership/deadline behavior, all33 original native body blocks (27 unchanged and6 strengthened), all actual baseline test2json cases,20-case selection,8 corrected source-composition outputs and the original CRLF-only local proof failure. Native's488f LocalOnly route review remains inside the frozen packet.

The exact V6 source/control packet and workflow are copied without edits. No second native build/test/CI dispatch occurs during this Git preparation. The parent reviewer must bind the final Git HEAD before the next normal trigger push.

